# =============================================================================
# fastik-landing — environment variables
# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) for local dev.
# =============================================================================

# --- Mac download (src/app/download/mac/route.ts) ----------------------------
# fastik-desktop is a private repo, so its release assets aren't publicly
# fetchable. This route uses the GitHub API server-side to fetch the latest
# release and redirect the visitor straight to the (short-lived, signed) asset
# URL — the .dmg's bytes never pass through this server.
#
# Create a fine-grained token at https://github.com/settings/tokens?type=beta
# scoped ONLY to the Fastik-App/fastik-desktop repository, with "Contents:
# Read-only" permission — nothing broader. Set the real value in your hosting
# platform's environment variables, never in a committed file.
FASTIK_DESKTOP_RELEASE_TOKEN=""
